<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Demand was light to moderate on a moderate movement. Top $57.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
